+# @api-version: Fence protocol version, one.
+# @epoch: Native virtual-clock owner epoch.
+# @state: armed, completed or cancelled.
+# @token: Fence owner token.
+# @display-token: Display observer token captured at arm time.
+# @baseline-update-id: Last published update when armed.
+# @updates: Current retained display update count.
+# @stop-pending: The fence stop request has not yet reached a safe stopped state.
+# @stop-consumed: The frame fence itself issued the VM stop after publication.
+#     A preexisting debugger or other stop clears stop-pending without setting
+#     this field.
+# @completed-update-id: Exact update ID published by this fence, when complete.
+# @published-ns: Actual virtual time of that completed publication.
